# Check every text file out with LF endings, on every platform.
#
# Prettier is configured with `endOfLine: "lf"`, so a Windows checkout under the
# default `core.autocrlf=true` would rewrite every file to CRLF and then fail
# `pnpm format:check` on all of them. Pinning it here fixes that for everyone
# rather than asking each contributor to configure Git correctly.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries must not be touched.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary

# Generated; keep it out of language stats and diffs.
pnpm-lock.yaml linguist-generated=true -diff
Cargo.lock linguist-generated=true -diff
